WEBVTT

01:43.450 --> 01:45.660
5, 6, 7, 8.

01:46.000 --> 01:48.170
2, 2, 3, 4.

01:48.500 --> 01:50.670
5, 6, 7, 8.

01:51.000 --> 01:52.920
3, 2, 3, 4.

01:53.880 --> 01:56.510
There's only one more week until the prefectural tournament.

01:58.180 --> 01:59.640
We can do it this year.

01:59.970 --> 02:01.720
I'm expecting good results from you, Ninagawa-san!

02:02.550 --> 02:03.810
Okay!

02:03.810 --> 02:05.390
Did you learn the rules?

02:05.390 --> 02:07.430
You're the star this year.

02:08.100 --> 02:09.140
Yes!

02:09.480 --> 02:11.650
Senpai's on fire.

02:11.980 --> 02:12.650
Now, begin!

02:13.690 --> 02:16.400
Amuro, starting now!

02:41.680 --> 02:43.140
Amuro!

02:55.270 --> 02:56.320
Geez.

02:56.320 --> 02:58.150
Get a hold of yourself.

02:59.110 --> 03:02.610
I can't believe that Amuro nearly drowned.

03:02.910 --> 03:04.120
Did her leg cramp up?

03:04.490 --> 03:06.450
What happened?

03:08.040 --> 03:14.250
I was really weak when I got into the water.

03:14.250 --> 03:15.420
Huh?

03:15.420 --> 03:18.880
Amuro-senpai, something seems different about you.

03:19.720 --> 03:21.630
Oh, you're right.

03:31.890 --> 03:33.940
Her other X is gone!

03:35.440 --> 03:37.610
What happened to the other one?

03:38.980 --> 03:40.820
Did it fall into the pool?

03:44.200 --> 03:46.160
I saw it a moment ago.

03:46.870 --> 03:50.750
The wind blew it away when she dove in.

03:59.460 --> 04:01.880
I really did see it!

04:01.920 --> 04:06.010
Is she feeling bad because her other X is gone?

04:06.050 --> 04:07.390
No way.

04:07.930 --> 04:09.010
No, that's it!

04:09.520 --> 04:10.810
Captain Ikamasa.

04:12.180 --> 04:15.230
Yes, it means that the X is...

04:17.020 --> 04:20.610
a device that controls Ninagawa's movements!

04:22.280 --> 04:23.990
What's with that image?

04:24.320 --> 04:27.030
But, doesn't she take them off during baths?

04:27.370 --> 04:30.410
Nah, the important part is that it's the other one!

04:30.410 --> 04:33.040
Geez, it doesn't matter.

04:33.460 --> 04:38.090
If that other X is going to fix her, let's hurry up and find it.

04:38.090 --> 04:39.460
It's a little bit suspicious, though.

04:47.220 --> 04:49.560
Geez, everyone is so unreliable.

04:55.270 --> 04:57.150
What was that for?!

04:57.150 --> 04:59.060
You made me scream with a weird voice!

04:59.060 --> 05:01.530
Umm... No, the X...

05:03.400 --> 05:04.900
It's flying away!

05:04.900 --> 05:08.030
Hey, stop standing around and chase after it!

05:08.030 --> 05:08.530
Huh?!

05:08.870 --> 05:11.200
We're going to fix Ninagawa-san.

05:11.200 --> 05:12.410
Go!

05:20.380 --> 05:23.550
Stop, floating ball!

05:24.170 --> 05:25.760
The swimming team?

05:38.190 --> 05:39.190
That was good.

05:39.480 --> 05:41.190
And what was the point of scoring?!

05:42.940 --> 05:45.360
I'm gonna play soccer for a bit.

05:45.360 --> 05:47.200
It's flying away again!

05:49.200 --> 05:50.910
It's going towards the city!

05:51.240 --> 05:53.660
Um, please wait!

05:55.620 --> 05:58.370
Are we going to the city dressed like this?

05:59.000 --> 06:03.170
U-Umm, can I at least go back and get a jacket?

06:03.500 --> 06:07.680
If we lose sight of the X and come back without it, Orizuka-senpai is going to kill us!

06:07.680 --> 06:08.680
B-But.

06:08.680 --> 06:10.180
Let's just go!

06:10.180 --> 06:11.600
We can skip practice.

06:11.600 --> 06:12.390
Yep, yep.

06:12.930 --> 06:15.560
Let's go!

06:16.560 --> 06:19.900
I can definitely... understand.

06:21.400 --> 06:24.110
P-Please move out of the way!

06:29.610 --> 06:30.950
They're looking at me.

06:30.950 --> 06:32.120
I knew it!

06:37.660 --> 06:41.130
I like looking, but being looked at...

06:43.960 --> 06:45.670
Wait!

06:51.840 --> 06:53.050
Maaya!

06:54.640 --> 06:55.970
Okky!

06:55.970 --> 06:58.180
So you came to enjoy the cafe with me.

06:58.180 --> 07:00.190
N-No...

07:00.190 --> 07:00.640
But...

07:02.650 --> 07:03.980
What's going on?!

07:03.980 --> 07:05.320
What about you?

07:05.320 --> 07:07.320
You're having tea while skipping practice.

07:07.320 --> 07:09.400
The X is our priority.

07:09.650 --> 07:10.450
X?

07:10.450 --> 07:15.950
Umm... Yeah, you know... Umm... Can you give me that X on you, Maaya?

07:18.870 --> 07:21.830
That X is Amuro's.

07:21.830 --> 07:24.420
We were chasing it because it got blown away by the wind.

07:24.420 --> 07:25.340
Yeah, yeah.

07:25.340 --> 07:26.710
We chased it.

07:26.710 --> 07:27.630
That's what happened.

07:29.130 --> 07:31.130
So you came all the way out here for this.

07:31.470 --> 07:33.390
Um, yeah.

07:41.100 --> 07:43.100
Why?!

07:43.440 --> 07:44.940
What the heck.

07:44.940 --> 07:46.650
All you guys do is talk about her.

07:46.650 --> 07:48.110
You're an idiot, Okky!

07:51.650 --> 07:53.610
We were so close.

07:57.620 --> 07:59.160
I've had enough.

07:59.160 --> 08:01.120
It fell somewhere around here.

08:01.120 --> 08:01.910
Geez.

08:01.910 --> 08:03.620
So, did you find it?!

08:07.630 --> 08:11.260
You guys lost sight of it?!

08:11.260 --> 08:14.130
No, we were close, and then Maaya...

08:15.590 --> 08:19.390
Well, I had 2 goals and 3 assists!

08:19.810 --> 08:22.100
I'll kick you!

08:25.600 --> 08:31.610
I had 2 goals and 3 assists...

08:32.030 --> 08:34.610
Me...

08:34.950 --> 08:39.410
Are you feeling bad because that X is gone?

08:41.120 --> 08:43.040
Maybe.

08:43.040 --> 08:45.790
My grandma's curse.

08:45.790 --> 08:46.750
Curse?

08:49.040 --> 08:52.970
My grandma said that I'd be cursed if I lost it.

08:55.470 --> 08:56.140
See!

08:56.140 --> 08:57.510
It was a curse!

08:57.510 --> 08:59.930
Didn't you say that it was a device?

09:00.560 --> 09:02.850
Then it's a cursing device!

09:08.190 --> 09:10.900
W-W-W-What should we do?

09:10.900 --> 09:13.570
Is there something we can substitute it with?

09:13.570 --> 09:15.740
Substitute, huh?

09:20.240 --> 09:22.240
Senpai, that's a...

09:23.580 --> 09:25.000
I guess it's no good.

09:25.750 --> 09:27.500
How about this?

09:27.500 --> 09:29.500
I picked it up at the beach a few minutes ago.

09:30.960 --> 09:32.760
That's cute!

09:32.760 --> 09:34.210
Kise-senpai, you're having fun, aren't you?

09:34.720 --> 09:36.260
You idiots!

09:36.260 --> 09:37.720
We fight curses with curses!

09:38.050 --> 09:40.470
With a shuriken, she can be a female ninja.

09:40.470 --> 09:42.220
The cat ears are basic.

09:43.430 --> 09:45.730
I... This... maid's...

09:45.730 --> 09:47.350
Hey, boys, don't get carried away!

09:49.230 --> 09:51.940
Geez, there's no choice.

09:51.940 --> 09:54.570
Let's leave Ninagawa-san alone,

09:54.570 --> 09:56.570
and hope she feels better soon.

10:00.700 --> 10:02.080
That X,

10:03.330 --> 10:06.080
it was given to her by her grandma, right?

10:08.000 --> 10:14.670
Last year, Amuro's grandma didn't return from a swim in the ocean.

10:15.050 --> 10:17.680
Amuro loved her grandma.

10:18.590 --> 10:23.140
The most important thing to me is in the ocean.

10:24.140 --> 10:26.390
I plan on returning the X's.

10:34.570 --> 10:36.030
Everyone, wait!

10:36.990 --> 10:39.110
Why don't we look for it a little longer?

10:39.450 --> 10:41.490
But we've already lost sight of it.

10:41.490 --> 10:43.450
It's too late now.

10:43.450 --> 10:45.580
She can buy another one.

10:45.580 --> 10:47.040
It has to be that X!

10:52.420 --> 10:57.670
Umm... I mean, that X is an important X given to her by her grandma.

11:00.470 --> 11:04.050
It could be that she's feeling down because she lost it.

11:12.900 --> 11:14.150
Kaname!

11:16.940 --> 11:21.410
Those chivalrous feelings for Ninagawa are making me cry!

11:24.070 --> 11:26.580
N-No, it's not...

11:27.240 --> 11:30.660
chivalrous or anything...

11:31.000 --> 11:33.630
So you all understand, right?!

11:33.630 --> 11:35.380
We're going to continue the search for the X!

11:36.800 --> 11:39.670
Thank you very much, Captain.

11:39.670 --> 11:41.180
Don't say that so formally!

11:41.510 --> 11:43.470
These guys are so easy to influence.

11:43.470 --> 11:44.640
It can't be helped.

11:44.640 --> 11:46.390
I guess we can tag along for a little bit longer.

11:46.390 --> 11:49.730
It'd be bad for the swim team if Ninagawa-san stayed like this.

11:49.730 --> 11:50.140
Yes.

11:50.480 --> 11:52.650
But, how are we going to find it?

11:53.480 --> 11:54.020
Foot.

11:54.360 --> 11:55.940
We will look on foot.

11:55.940 --> 11:58.610
You all go your separate ways and ask around!

11:58.610 --> 11:59.490
Yes.

11:59.490 --> 12:00.030
Uh...

12:00.030 --> 12:03.780
U-Umm... Can I change?

12:04.240 --> 12:08.160
Can I at least wear a jacket?

12:08.160 --> 12:10.540
I don't like being looked at...

12:31.230 --> 12:32.480
What the heck.

12:32.810 --> 12:36.440
Okky and the others.

12:36.440 --> 12:38.520
"Amuro this, Amuro that."

12:38.520 --> 12:40.610
Is Maaya being ignored?

12:44.530 --> 12:47.370
Maaya is definitely cute!

12:47.870 --> 12:49.370
This is also cute.

12:52.370 --> 12:53.620
This is...

13:01.550 --> 13:04.340
pissing me off!

13:09.300 --> 13:10.810
Have you seen this?

13:12.810 --> 13:14.440
An X...

13:16.520 --> 13:17.900
Captain!

13:17.900 --> 13:18.520
Wear it.

13:35.410 --> 13:37.460
Let's ask the people in here.

13:37.460 --> 13:38.710
Yes, Senpai.

13:40.540 --> 13:41.670
Good looking guy.

13:43.760 --> 13:45.720
He might be my type.

13:46.050 --> 13:48.050
Shizuoka, I'll leave this place to you.

13:48.050 --> 13:49.090
Kise-sen...

13:52.140 --> 13:53.930
Excuse me.

13:56.270 --> 13:57.940
Hello.

13:58.270 --> 14:00.230
I wonder if anyone is here.

14:00.610 --> 14:02.190
Excuse me.

14:02.190 --> 14:03.150
Umm...

14:03.150 --> 14:03.610
Pe...

14:10.870 --> 14:11.910
Peni...

14:24.920 --> 14:27.170
What should I do?

14:27.170 --> 14:29.010
Should I buy it?

14:29.010 --> 14:30.340
20,000 yen.

14:30.340 --> 14:32.350
I wonder if I can use my credit card.

14:32.350 --> 14:33.970
Maybe I should buy it.

14:33.970 --> 14:38.390
But a girl taking this to the cash register...

14:38.390 --> 14:39.600
Can I help you?

14:40.440 --> 14:41.480
Go ahead.

14:41.480 --> 14:42.820
N-No.

14:43.320 --> 14:44.190
Umm...

14:45.820 --> 14:47.190
I can't buy it.

14:48.900 --> 14:50.950
No need to hold back.

14:52.030 --> 14:54.700
I want to say it without holding back.

14:55.950 --> 14:59.210
God... Please...

15:00.540 --> 15:03.210
give me...

15:04.130 --> 15:07.460
the courage,

15:08.380 --> 15:11.470
the courage to buy...

15:12.010 --> 15:14.640
this peni!

15:16.180 --> 15:18.980
I'll take this!

15:19.310 --> 15:20.980
Sure thing.

15:22.900 --> 15:24.270
All right!

15:24.270 --> 15:25.440
I did it!

15:25.440 --> 15:26.690
Thank you, God!

15:27.030 --> 15:30.820
You're so young, but you're into this kind of stuff, huh?

15:30.820 --> 15:32.410
Y-Yes.

15:32.410 --> 15:34.620
We don't get this kind of stuff in very often.

15:34.620 --> 15:36.240
I see.

15:36.240 --> 15:38.410
I'll ring this up over there.

15:38.410 --> 15:39.200
Yes.

15:42.880 --> 15:44.460
That one...

15:44.750 --> 15:46.670
Um, excuse me.

15:49.590 --> 15:50.420
What's up?

15:51.430 --> 15:53.590
Oops, wrong person!

15:54.430 --> 15:56.430
It's not here.

15:56.890 --> 16:00.560
Maybe it's impossible to find something that small.

16:00.560 --> 16:02.690
No, that's not true.

16:18.990 --> 16:21.960
Geez, you look like Ono-chan, Amuro.

16:21.960 --> 16:23.210
Really.

16:28.460 --> 16:29.670
The X...

16:29.670 --> 16:30.710
Captain!

16:31.130 --> 16:32.720
We can't find it.

16:33.720 --> 16:38.510
Geez, what do you want me to do with this?

16:38.510 --> 16:39.430
Mirei-san.

16:40.180 --> 16:42.060
What's in that bag?

16:42.060 --> 16:43.940
It's nothing.

16:44.480 --> 16:46.440
He wasn't my type.

16:47.270 --> 16:49.020
What terrible luck.

16:51.940 --> 16:55.450
You guys, what about the X?

16:55.740 --> 16:57.990
We couldn't find it.

16:57.990 --> 16:59.450
What about you?

16:59.790 --> 17:03.960
Hey, it looks like she's weaker than before.

17:03.960 --> 17:05.420
What should we do?!

17:05.420 --> 17:07.580
At this rate, Amuro-senpai is going to die!

17:07.920 --> 17:09.840
Stop overreacting.

17:16.050 --> 17:17.300
The X!

17:17.640 --> 17:19.560
We will capture it for sure this time!

17:19.560 --> 17:20.720
Go!

17:27.860 --> 17:30.150
Wait!

17:34.650 --> 17:35.650
X!

18:04.180 --> 18:07.690
When it comes to this, we have to rely on the real deal.

18:07.690 --> 18:08.980
The real deal?

18:08.980 --> 18:09.940
All right, everyone!

18:09.940 --> 18:11.480
Let's get going!

18:11.980 --> 18:13.440
Hey, where to?!

18:19.620 --> 18:21.950
Are we supposed to find it here?

18:21.950 --> 18:22.790
Nanmaida.

18:22.790 --> 18:23.910
Nanmaida.

18:23.910 --> 18:25.700
I pray to find the X soon.

18:27.500 --> 18:30.630
I pray for the blessing of being involved in something erotic soon.

18:30.630 --> 18:31.790
This should do it.

18:31.790 --> 18:32.540
"Do it?"

18:32.540 --> 18:33.380
You mean...

18:33.380 --> 18:35.760
At times like this, you gotta ask God.

18:38.010 --> 18:40.340
It's not a god!

18:40.340 --> 18:42.100
It's Buddha!

18:44.600 --> 18:48.440
Takeda got dragged in with him.

18:48.440 --> 18:49.690
Look at this!

18:49.690 --> 18:50.940
This is hot!

18:50.940 --> 18:52.020
Okay!

18:53.270 --> 18:54.320
Geez.

18:54.320 --> 18:56.530
You dragged us here just for this?!

18:56.530 --> 18:58.950
You're intense today.

19:07.450 --> 19:08.410
What is it?

19:08.410 --> 19:09.620
You're so loud.

19:09.620 --> 19:11.290
Up! Up!

19:13.090 --> 19:15.170
There it is!

19:15.170 --> 19:16.340
Are you serious?!

19:16.340 --> 19:17.380
We did it!

19:17.380 --> 19:19.590
Buddha heard their prayers!

19:19.590 --> 19:21.140
N-No way!

19:21.140 --> 19:22.220
What a coincidence!

19:22.550 --> 19:24.220
Look, look, look!

19:24.220 --> 19:26.930
But... Getting it seems impossible.

19:26.930 --> 19:28.430
It's too high up.

19:28.430 --> 19:29.890
Should we wait until it comes down?

19:29.890 --> 19:33.560
If it gets blown away again, I don't think we'll be able to find it.

19:33.560 --> 19:35.730
No, there is a way to get it.

19:36.230 --> 19:39.450
We will get the X with everyone's beautiful cooperation!

19:43.950 --> 19:46.370
Now, it's Shizuoka-senpai's turn!

19:46.370 --> 19:48.200
Get on Kaname-senpai!

19:50.290 --> 19:52.250
Open your legs wider.

19:52.250 --> 19:53.460
Y-Yes.

19:53.460 --> 19:55.290
Excuse me.

19:56.750 --> 20:00.420
I might be a little heavy.

20:01.260 --> 20:04.720
No, or, or, or...

20:05.010 --> 20:07.430
And then on top her, Takeda-senpai!

20:08.600 --> 20:11.690
I'm on top of Shizuoka-san.

20:11.690 --> 20:14.440
Buddha heard my prayers.

20:14.860 --> 20:17.940
And then, if Makio gets on top of him...

20:19.900 --> 20:22.400
Friendship "Beauty" Riding on Shoulders!

20:22.400 --> 20:24.200
It is complete!

20:33.920 --> 20:35.670
A little closer...

20:37.590 --> 20:39.170
Makio-chan, do your best.

20:40.050 --> 20:42.420
Isn't there a better way?

20:42.800 --> 20:44.640
Hurry up.

20:46.140 --> 20:47.890
A little closer.

20:57.150 --> 20:58.730
Oh no.

21:00.780 --> 21:04.070
Ikamasa-kun at the bottom looks like he's at his limit.

21:06.280 --> 21:09.700
It's shaking!

21:10.660 --> 21:12.540
It's going down!

21:16.710 --> 21:17.670
There!

21:24.930 --> 21:28.430
Amuro, I thought you couldn't move.

21:28.760 --> 21:32.930
When I ate steam bun offerings, I got my energy back!

21:33.930 --> 21:41.190
When I thought about it, I played around too much during lunch break, and I forgot to eat lunch.

21:42.280 --> 21:44.990
So the X has nothing to do with it.

21:44.990 --> 21:46.450
Okiura, you jumped to conclusions.

21:47.570 --> 21:48.910
I'm sorry.

21:53.410 --> 21:56.500
Kaname-chan, thanks a lot for today.

21:57.500 --> 21:59.040
I was very happy.

22:00.040 --> 22:02.550
Oh, you heard about that.

22:07.380 --> 22:09.890
Hey, hey, do you remember this place?

22:18.650 --> 22:21.320
The place where I met Amuro for the first time.

22:23.820 --> 22:24.780
Wrong!

22:25.780 --> 22:27.360
The second time.

22:27.360 --> 22:29.110
We met at Churaumi the first time.

22:29.570 --> 22:31.080
Yeah, yeah.

22:31.080 --> 22:32.790
She's still saying that.

22:59.770 --> 23:01.270
The curse of the X?

23:02.650 --> 23:04.730
It's one of Grandma's lies.

23:06.320 --> 23:07.740
Lies?

23:08.240 --> 23:09.860
It's so good!

24:45.960 --> 24:47.630
The prefectural tournament is finally here.

24:48.050 --> 24:50.550
Let's do our best with what we learned at training camp.

24:50.960 --> 24:54.050
Hey, I want you guys to wear this to show team work,

24:54.130 --> 24:56.390
and who said you can wear that?!

24:56.800 --> 25:01.520
Geez, that sugary voice, it's you!

25:01.600 --> 25:02.850
I definitely can't lose to you!

25:03.980 --> 25:06.110
T-The loser has to do a nip slip?

25:06.190 --> 25:07.480
I'll do it!

25:07.900 --> 25:10.230
Next time on Kenkou Zenrakei Suieibu Umisho,

25:10.320 --> 25:12.150
"Take a Good Look"

25:12.240 --> 25:14.200
I won't be able to get married!
